&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;margin-top:1pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;(注) 取引条件及び取引条件の決定方針等&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:44.5pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-13pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;賃借料等については、近隣の家賃等を参考に一般取引と同様に決定しています。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:1pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:58.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:1pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;連結財務諸表提出会社の非連結子会社&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:67.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:1pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;非連結子会社への貸倒懸念債権に対し、865百万円の貸倒引当金を計上しています。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:67.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:1pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;また、当連結会計年度において175百万円の貸倒引当金繰入額を計上しています。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:1pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRelatedPartiesConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesPerShareInformationConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
